sequenceDiagram
    autonumber 10 10
    participant A as Alice
    participant B as Bob
    A->B: Solid without arrow
    A-->B: Dashed without arrow
    A->>B: Solid arrow
    B-->>A: Dashed reply
    A-xB: Solid cross
    B--xA: Dashed cross
    A-)B: Async
    B--)A: Dashed async
    A<<->>B: Bidirectional
    A->>A: Self call
    B-->>B: Self reply<br/>second line
    Note left of A: Left note
    Note right of B: Right note<br/>second line
